msgid "GA Installation"
msgstr "GA安装"

msgid ""
"We recommend building Molpro with the `Global Arrays toolkit "
"<https://github.com/GlobalArrays/ga>`__, using the latest stable version."
msgstr ""
"我们建议使用\\ `Global Arrays工具包 <https://github.com/GlobalArrays/ga>`__\\ "
"构建Molpro，并使用最新的稳定版本。"

msgid ""
"There are different ways (GA \"runtimes\") to configure the GA library which"
" significantly affect the execution and options, and they are therefore "
"important from a users point of view. The current default of the GA "
"installation is to use ``--with-mpi-ts``, which is **very slow** and should "
"be avoided. Our current recommendation is to use ``--with-mpi-pr``, "
"preferably using the latest version of openmpi with UCX."
msgstr ""
"配置GA库有多种方式（GA“运行时”），这些方式会显著影响执行过程和选项，因此从用户角度来看非常重要。目前GA安装的默认配置是使用\\ "
"``--with-mpi-ts``\\ ，这种方式\\ **非常慢**\\ ，应避免使用。我们目前的建议是使用\\ ``--with-mpi-"
"pr``\\ ，最好搭配使用UCX的最新版openmpi。"

msgid ""
"Note that openmpi may not work with ``--ga-impl disk`` when multiple "
"parallel Molpro calculations are executed simultaneously on a node."
msgstr "请注意，当在一个节点上同时执行多个并行Molpro计算时，openmpi可能无法与\\ ``--ga-impl disk``\\ 配合工作。"

msgid ""
"If a job scheduler is used, please also check the manual of the job "
"scheduler for special instructions on how to run MPI programs. For example, "
"using openmpi under slurm requires the proper configuration of the "
"`MpiDefault option <https://slurm.schedmd.com/mpi_guide.html#open_mpi>`__. "
"*Failure in doing so may result crashes or incorrect computation results.*"
msgstr ""
"如果使用了作业调度器，请同时查阅作业调度器的手册，了解运行MPI程序的特殊说明。例如，在slurm下使用openmpi需要正确配置\\ "
"`MpiDefault选项 <https://slurm.schedmd.com/mpi_guide.html#open_mpi>`__\\ 。\\ "
"*否则可能导致崩溃或计算结果错误。*"

msgid ""
"Older GA runtimes do not need any helper processes, but have a serious "
"disadvantage that with ``--ga-impl ga`` (the default for multi-node "
"calculations since Molpro 2021.2 and for all calculations in earlier "
"versions), the GA software frequently crashes or gives wrong numbers if "
"several GAs are allocated whose total size exceeds 16 GB (2 MW). This can be"
" avoided by using ``--ga-impl disk`` (default for single-node calculations "
"since Molpro 2021.2), or allocating in the beginning of the job a very large"
" GA with at least the size of the total GA space needed in the calculation "
"(which is not known in advance). The latter can be done with the ``-G`` or "
"``-M`` molpro options. See :doc:`Running Molpro on parallel computers "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"较旧的GA运行时不需要任何辅助进程，但有一个严重缺点：当使用\\ ``--ga-impl ga``\\ （自Molpro "
"2021.2起多节点计算的默认值，以及早期版本中所有计算的默认值）时，如果分配了多个GA且其总大小超过16 GB（2 "
"MW），GA软件经常崩溃或给出错误的数值。可以通过使用\\ ``--ga-impl disk``\\ （自Molpro "
"2021.2起单节点计算的默认值）来避免此问题，或者在作业开始时分配一个非常大的GA，其大小至少等于计算中所需的总GA空间（这一点无法预先知道）。后者可以通过molpro的\\"
" ``-G``\\ 或\\ ``-M``\\ 选项实现。更多细节请参见\\ :doc:`在并行计算机上运行Molpro "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers>`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The ``mpi-pr`` runtime requires one helper process from each node. Thus, if "
"for example ``-n40`` is specified as molpro options in a 2-node calculation,"
" only 38 MPI processes run molpro, and 2 additional helper processes are "
"started. The performance of ``mpi-pr`` runtime is usually comparable to the "
"``socket`` or ``openib`` runtims. GA preallocation is not needed and "
"automatically disabled by Molpro with the ``mpi-pr`` runtime."
msgstr ""
"``mpi-pr``\\ 运行时需要每个节点提供一个辅助进程。因此，例如在2节点计算中，如果molpro选项指定了\\ ``-n40``\\ "
"，则只有38个MPI进程运行molpro，另外会启动2个辅助进程。\\ ``mpi-pr``\\ 运行时的性能通常与\\ ``socket``\\ "
"或\\ ``openib``\\ 运行时相当。使用\\ ``mpi-pr``\\ 运行时不需要GA预分配，Molpro会自动禁用。"

msgid ""
"The ``socket`` and ``openib`` GA runtimes uses System V shared memory while "
"the ``mpi-pr`` runtime uses POSIX shared memory. In the former case you may "
"need to raise the value of ``SHMMAX`` and ``SHMALL`` kernel parameters, "
"while in the latter case to raise the size-limit of ``/dev/shm``. Also note "
"that even in successful calculations shared memory segments are sometimes "
"left in ``/dev/shm``. These can accumulate to make a machine unusable, and "
"should therefore be deleted from time to time."
msgstr ""
"``socket``\\ 和\\ ``openib`` GA运行时使用System V共享内存，而\\ ``mpi-pr``\\ "
"运行时使用POSIX共享内存。在前一种情况下，您可能需要提高内核参数\\ ``SHMMAX``\\ 和\\ ``SHMALL``\\ "
"的值，而在后一种情况下，需要提高\\ ``/dev/shm``\\ 的大小限制。另请注意，即使在成功的计算中，共享内存段有时也会残留在\\ "
"``/dev/shm``\\ 中。这些残留可能会积累导致机器无法使用，因此应不时删除。"

msgid ""
"Queries regarding Global Arrays installations should be sent directly to the"
" Global Arrays team, any Molpro related queries will assume a fully "
"functional Global Arrays suite with all internal tests run successfully."
msgstr ""
"有关Global Arrays安装的问题应直接发送给Global Arrays团队，任何与Molpro相关的问题都将假定Global "
"Arrays套件功能完整且所有内部测试均已成功运行。"
